message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "benchling-tools"
version: 0.8.0
date-released: "2026-11-23"
abstract: >-
  Safe, auditable tools for AI agents working in Benchling: a JSON-first CLI
  and a read-only-by-default MCP server. Every change is first recorded as an
  immutable, checksummed plan with version preconditions; a separate apply
  step re-checks those preconditions and writes an execution journal.
  Unofficial; not affiliated with or endorsed by Benchling, Inc.
